{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἀρχὴν ἁπάντων καὶ τέλος ποιοῦ Θεόν."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "βίου τὸ κέρδος εὖ βιοῦν καθ᾿ ἡμέραν."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "3", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "γίνωσκε πάντα τῶν καλῶν τὰ δράματα."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "4", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "δεινὸν πένεσθαι, χεῖρον δ᾿ εὐπορεῖν κακῶς."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "5", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "εὐεργετῶν νόμιζε μιμεῖσθαι Θεόν."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "6", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ζήτει θεοῦ σοι χρηστότητα χρηστὸς ὤν."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "7", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἡ σὰρξ κρατείσθω καὶ δαμαζέσθω καλῶς."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "8", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "θυμὸν χαλίνου, μὴ φρενῶν ἔξω πέσῃς."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "9", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἵστη μὲν ὄμμα, γλῶσσα δὲ στάθμην ἔχοι."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "10", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κλεὶς ὠσὶ κείσθω, μηδὲ πορνεύοι γέλως."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "11", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "λύχνος βίου σοι παντὸς ἡγείσθω λόγος."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "12", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "μή σοι τὸ εἶναι τῷ δοκεῖν ὑπορρέοι."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "13", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "νόει τὰ πάντα, πρᾶσσε δ᾿ ἃ πράσσειν θέμις."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "14", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ξένον σεαυτὸν ἴσθι, καὶ τίμα ξένους."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "15", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὅτ᾿ εὐπλοεῖς, μάλιστα μέμνησο ζάλης."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "16", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πάντ᾿ εὐχαρίστως δεῖ δέχεσθαι τἀκ Θεοῦ."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "17", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ῥάβδος δικαίου πλεῖον ἢ τιμὴ κακοῦ."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "18", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "σοφῶν θύρας ἔκτριβε, πλουσίων δὲ μή."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "19", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "τὸ μικρὸν οὐ μικρόν, ὅταν ἐκφέρῃ μέγα."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "21", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "φύλασσε σαυτόν, πτῶμα δ᾿ ἄλλου μὴ γέλα."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "22", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "χάρις φθονεῖσθαι, τὸ φθονεῖν δ᾿ αἶσχος μέγα."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "23", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ψυχὴ θύοιτο μᾶλλον ἢ τὸ πᾶν θεῷ."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nazianzenus.carmina-moralia", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "24", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὢ τίς φυλάξει ταῦτα καὶ σωθήσεται."}
